	(text "NOTE: net names are kept as in the Cambridge service manual. The output of THIS (right) channel is LO;\nits other channel nets are LE1, LE2, LFCLIP, LICLIP. The Left Channel sheet uses RO, RE1, RE2, RFCLIP, RICLIP.\nThe L/R letters in these net names do not match the channel names - this is how the manual names them."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 49.53 0)
