	(text "Changes (marked **): R121** parallel to R68 (fail-safe bias); TP4**, TP5**, TP6** bias test points\n(bias: >13 mV across each 0.22R emitter resistor). R96**/R98** 1W flameproof; C41** 470u NP; C39** film;\nR50**/C28** Zobel non-inductive/film."
